            "question_1": "How Soon Will I See Results?",
            "use_product_description_for_question_1": false,
            "answer_1": "<p>Most men report feeling more natural energy and focus within the first few days. <strong>Bedroom benefits like improved stamina and performance can be noticed within 6-8 weeks</strong> of consistent use. Remember — Alpha Brew isn’t a “magic pill.” It works by supporting healthy testosterone and blood flow naturally over time.</p>",
